43", "created_at": "2026-10-13T17:28:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110060033010716893"], "id": "2110060033010716893", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Hon'ble Chief Minister Suvendu Adhikari, could you please look into why visitors are being charged for entry at the Tala Prattoy Durga Puja pandal? Durga Puja is a festival for everyone, and many devotees feel that such charges may discourage participation.#DurgaPuja #TalaPrattoy", "url": "https://x.com/arnab235/status/2110060033010716893"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-13T17:14:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110056571740848345"], "id": "2110056571740848345", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Mshree1166 @InfraAddaofWB Tridhara Sammilani Durga Puja pandal is at 107, Manoharpukur, Kalighat, Kolkata 700029. Near Deshapriya Park and Rashbehari Avenue in South Kolkata.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2110056571740848345"}, {"author_id": "3236685834", "created_at": "2026-10-13T17:14:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110056528262905928"], "id": "2110056528262905928", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 593, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "My Pujo routine is never about covering all big pujos.\nI pick and select the pujos beforehand. Try to select the best time with less crowd and spend time on it. Clicking pictures, soaking and understanding every aspect and trying to stay there until the volunteers force me out.", "url": "https://x.com/goonereol/status/2110056528262905928"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110056047503360000", "3_2110056089089961984", "3_2110056126515752960", "3_2110056145746546688"]}, "author_id": "3790120694", "created_at": "2026-10-13T17:12:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110056161345212701"], "id": "2110056161345212701", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 87, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Empowering Young Minds for a Safer Digital World-\nCyber Awareness Programme was conducted by Sribhumi Police at PM Shri Kendriya Vidyalaya to educate students on protecting their digital identities and staying safe from cyber fraud. Together, let’s build a Cyber Smart generation. https://t.co/qZpy10IhlC", "url": "https://x.com/sribhumipolice/status/2110056161345212701"}, {"author_id": "53725955", "created_at": "2026-10-13T17:07:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110054950638432355"], "id": "2110054950638432355", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Why we residents of Laketown are facing the same trauma while coming from airport to detour all the way till Ultadanga  then taking an Uturn and then again getting stuck in Sreebhumi increasing my journey time by 30 mins? \n@drsharadwat @bidhannagarpc @paulagnimitra1", "url": "https://x.com/uncannyamrita/status/2110054950638432355"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110052456835215360"]}, "author_id": "1341576373672898561", "created_at": "2026-10-13T16:58:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110052467648180659"], "id": "2110052467648180659", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 5, "impression_count": 1843, "like_count": 306, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "#8 Visited Park Circus Beniapukur United.\n(Padma Shri Sanatan Rudra Pal) https://t.co/m3P3fHZbqg", "url": "https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2110052467648180659"}, {"author_id": "1023150691030728704", "created_at": "2026-10-13T16:51:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110050826500911416"], "id": "2110050826500911416", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 131, "like_c